From 3cc83d9ad1808712f8b4c46ab6413326b89ded7b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mikekinney@Mikes-MacBook-Pro.local>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 16:59:11 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): orthographic view maps depth to wgpu's 0..1 so the
 scene draws

The ortho branch of Camera::mvp used glOrtho's depth row (z -1..1).
WebGPU clips 0 <= z <= w and ortho clip.w is 1, so every point nearer
than (near + far) / 2 - twenty orbit distances out - was clipped and
the viewport went blank. Map near..far linearly to 0..1 instead; the
Less test against the 1.0 clear and the composite's 0..1 frag_depth
check already assume that range.

Fixes #600

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL
